{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-67","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与中项无理线段与线段","englishTitle":"A straight line commensurable in length with a bimedial straight line is itself also bimedial and the same in order.","book":10,"number":67,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.67","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.67/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":67,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-67@raw-e6497d13ee92a0ee","contentId":"euclid-10-67","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e6497d13ee92a0ee4a11cadbacade951dfae915b957576ea20e332ef8cae426c","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-67.statement","euclid-10-67.construction.1","euclid-10-67.proof.1","euclid-10-67.proof.2","euclid-10-67.proof.3","euclid-10-67.proof.4","euclid-10-67.proof.5","euclid-10-67.proof.6","euclid-10-67.proof.7","euclid-10-67.proof.8","euclid-10-67.proof.9","euclid-10-67.proof.10","euclid-10-67.conclusion","euclid-10-67.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-67.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-67","revisionId":"euclid-10-67@raw-e6497d13ee92a0ee","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f30a88185367a621f3164cf3de462122bd76f50dd955ee259302ab5c8a826ebf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"A straight line commensurable in length with a bimedial straight line is itself also bimedial and the same in order."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"长度可公度线双中项无理线段线,本身也是双中项无理线段线,顺序相同。（相关点与线段：A）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-67.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-67","revisionId":"euclid-10-67@raw-e6497d13ee92a0ee","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9f1137fdeebf2889065607e60fcab5cb85fc3f4b2aff28793db8c1eedfd734dc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be bimedial, and let CD be commensurable in length with AB; I say that CD is bimedial and the same in order with AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB成为双中项无理线段,让CD成为长度可公度,AB成为AB;我说,CD就是双中项无理线段,AB也是这样。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-67.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-67","revisionId":"euclid-10-67@raw-e6497d13ee92a0ee","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"efa893d192feeddf1a354a85b8a980b6f929ade0c0de30ec532ca6f808178663","citations":["euclid-10-37"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AB is bimedial, let it be divided into its medials at E; therefore AE, EB are medial straight lines commensurable in square only. [[X. 37, 38](/principles/euclid-10-37)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AB是双中项无理线段,所以在E时将其分为中间部分;因此,AE,EB是中项无理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度。 [[X. 37, 38](/principles/euclid-10-37)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-67.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-67","revisionId":"euclid-10-67@raw-e6497d13ee92a0ee","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d8690567e6325de4e535e5a76ca9b4efc762f6d71a6338cf81716725bd1b06a","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let it be contrived that, as AB is to CD, so is AE to CF; therefore also the remainder EB is to the remainder FD as AB is to CD. [[V. 19](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设AB对CD的比等于AE对CF的比;因此,其余的EB等于其余的FD,因为AB等于CD；AB 与 CD 之比等于 AE 与 CF 之比。 [[V. 19](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-67.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-67","revisionId":"euclid-10-67@raw-e6497d13ee92a0ee","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"06eb4a85072020324d14e8e5a6a3d1a4743ff78da417ca25d47da647c3c6e95a","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB is commensurable in length with CD; therefore AE, EB are also commensurable with CF, FD respectively. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB为长度可公度,CD;因此,AE为EB,可公度,CF,FD。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-67.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-67","revisionId":"euclid-10-67@raw-e6497d13ee92a0ee","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca6d2ebd10a7273f55c04fe6a0e4a027187a89237d303592c20b39a52d508974","citations":["euclid-10-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AE, EB are medial; therefore CF, FD are also medial. [[X. 23](/principles/euclid-10-23)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AE,EB是中项无理线段,因此CF,FD也是中项无理线段。 [[X. 23](/principles/euclid-10-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-67.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-67","revisionId":"euclid-10-67@raw-e6497d13ee92a0ee","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a2d04d5b66b1478ca7d12e741d5c5460a1e44b6866431cc8f7ff49ee82301391","citations":["euclid-5-11","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as AE is to EB, so is CF to FD, [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] and AE, EB are commensurable in square only, CF, FD are also commensurable in square only. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE比EB等于CF比FD,AE比EB等于平方可公度而长度不可公度,CF比FD；AE 与 EB 之比等于 CF 与 FD 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-67.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-67","revisionId":"euclid-10-67@raw-e6497d13ee92a0ee","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"19ac1de682c7337e440d616f06d5f1c11e16545530b281b0a16a30cafec2f7b9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But they were also proved medial; therefore CD is bimedial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但也有中项无理线段件证据,因此CD件是双中项无理线段件。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-67.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-67","revisionId":"euclid-10-67@raw-e6497d13ee92a0ee","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3096b37857cfaeec72c741b9af46403e3ffc230cf893c0b9f8b131a8710d017c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also the same in order with AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,AB也是一样的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-67.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-67","revisionId":"euclid-10-67@raw-e6497d13ee92a0ee","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"80b0adcb3234e9365168426c538d4537b208b5496686d8c11445059b8c72ea71","citations":["euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as AE is to EB, so is CF to FD, therefore also, as the square on AE is to the rectangle AE, EB, so is the square on CF to the rectangle CF, FD; therefore, alternately, as the square on AE is to the square on CF, so is the rectangle AE, EB to the rectangle CF, FD. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AE对EB的比等于CF对FD的比,AE对矩形对EB的比也是EB对矩形对矩形对EB,CF对矩形对矩形对CF对矩形对FD;因此,AE对正方形对CF对正方形对正方形对CF的比也是FD;同样,矩形对AE对矩形对矩形对EB对矩形对CF的比也是FD；AE 与 EB 之比等于 CF 与 FD 之比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-67.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-67","revisionId":"euclid-10-67@raw-e6497d13ee92a0ee","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2392cc1b4f24e4b94767e884f0d13af315f34a1e8cced5b6686a8480c856534b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on AE is commensurable with the square on CF; therefore the rectangle AE, EB is also commensurable with the rectangle CF, FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AE正方形可公度CF正方形可公度,因此矩形AEEB可公度可公度矩形、CF、FD矩形、FD可公度可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-67.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-67","revisionId":"euclid-10-67@raw-e6497d13ee92a0ee","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d66ee9bf06625acc0a90237917ccc641430c67c37689ea7f8221a8fd6fe6924b","citations":["euclid-10-37","euclid-10-23","euclid-10-38"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If therefore the rectangle AE, EB is rational, the rectangle CF, FD is also rational, [and for this reason CD is a first bimedial]; [[X. 37](/principles/euclid-10-37)] but if medial, medial, [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)] and each of the straight lines AB, CD is a second bimedial. [[X. 38](/principles/euclid-10-38)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果矩形 AE,EB是有理,矩形 CF,FD也是有理,[因此,CD是第一个双中项无理线段];如果中项无理线段,中项无理线段,AE,CD是第二个双中项无理线段,那么,如果每条直线AB,CD是第二个双中项无理线段。 [[X. 37](/principles/euclid-10-37)] [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)] [[X. 38](/principles/euclid-10-38)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-67.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-67","revisionId":"euclid-10-67@raw-e6497d13ee92a0ee","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e4ca28bbe59207583a6c942ca11654da04a073fe440aa6a97cdc529fc14cdb6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And for this reason CD will be the same in order with AB. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CD将是相同的,AB. 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-67.source","contentId":"euclid-10-67","revisionId":"euclid-10-67@raw-e6497d13ee92a0ee","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf41232e559946a18ec665baf2201991ba33cd49618dce9461baaf55a2a7427f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.67/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.67\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-67:euclid-10-37:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-67","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-67.proof.1","euclid-10-67.proof.10"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-37","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.67","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799